his game is an absolute buggy mess. Shame what happened to Bioware.", "timestamp_created": 1702183329, "timestamp_updated": 1702183329, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.415660649538040161", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153266470", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046209495", "personaname": "niklemieux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046209495/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5165, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4881, "last_played": 1789342393, "avatar": "34474c2ebe9101701fdba567a43007cf344e234e"}, "language": "english", "review": "i played the game and the multiplayer is awesome. \n\nThe thing is that when i tried to open it the other day, the game asked for a key. it is a known bug but all the solution EA support told me didnt work.\n\nSo yeah sick game but EA is complete garbage useless crap. Im pissed.", "timestamp_created": 1702180582, "timestamp_updated": 1702180582, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 15, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.589639008045196533", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153083748", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994385987", "personaname": "Breaker1212", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994385987/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2512, "last_played": 1701995267, "avatar": "1aeda4d3a713ca1ce0a893eddf9f963430e5f1ea"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really enjoy this game. The story, the controls, the visuals; they were all fantastic! I only wish I played this years ago when it came out.", "timestamp_created": 1701995326, "timestamp_updated": 1701995326, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152896305", "author": {"steamid": "76561199066213912", "personaname": "BamboozleD527", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199066213912/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1386, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1385, "last_played": 1701735008, "avatar": "d5536ab2547df41085508d5121a4b2df16b1ec2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has never launched correctly with Origin and now with EA. So many errors. Now it's asking for a product key, or I need to completely re-buy the game through EA. EA is a complete joke. Don't waste your time or money purchasing this.", "timestamp_created": 1701733352, "timestamp_updated": 1701733352, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523306310176849365", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152856369", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025025988", "personaname": "MeddlingHuman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/meddlingh/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2406, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 787, "last_played": 1702473081, "avatar": "357d25b7df794b1463810e3508bb9199d6b5b622"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game gets a negative review from me for two main reasons.\n1) Forcing this EA ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ on my computer that I didn't ask for and don't need.  Requiring me to create a useless account so they can tie it to my Steam account and profile me further.\n2) Declaring 'T' a magic key that I may not remap.  This one is just embarrassing, incompetence rather than malice.\n\nI can live with the weird cutscene bugs where characters spin around or disappear, the weird ladder bug where I just hang in the air for several seconds instead of going down the ladder, and the janky sometimes skippable and sometimes unpausable dialogue.  But those two things are too obvious a sign of the contempt this company has for their players now.", "timestamp_created": 1701677762, "timestamp_updated": 1701677762, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.524049103260040283", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152834760", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091916731", "personaname": "Sometimes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091916731/", "num_games_owned": 67, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 19579, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3155, "deck_playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1771897354, "avatar": "adda48cc1e619833cf5f430533f16f41edbf9d41"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely not recommended, unless you enjoy installation headaches. Trying to import save files is a pain, and that's not even touching how frustrating it is when the outdated launcher demands a product key you may not even have. Used to run fine on this PC, then after I did a wipe and attempted to reinstall, it flat out refused authorization. Even if you have the key, the launcher perpetually thinks you're offline and doesn't allow you to enter it.\n\nDon't give EA your money - just watch a playthrough on YouTube or something. They're doing everything they can to force folks to buy this game in the Legendary Edition remaster.", "timestamp_created": 1701642180, "timestamp_updated": 1701642180, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.558253109455108643", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}